flowchart LR
    Task[AI or human change contract] --> Search[Search · reuse · extend · compose]
    Search --> SharedDomain[Reusable pure gameplay domains]
    Search --> GameDomain[Game-specific pure domain]
    Search --> Presentation[Runtime-specific presentation]
    SharedDomain --> GameDomain
    GameDomain --> Tests[Seed sweeps · invariants · replay]

    Profile[Player profile + typed preferences] --> Generator[Deterministic island generator]
    Generator --> Blueprint[Versioned IslandBlueprint]
    Blueprint --> Repository[IslandRepository]
    Blueprint --> IslandScene[Personal 3D island]
    IslandScene --> Hub[Typed registry and lazy game lifecycle]
    Hub --> Games[Parking Jam · Junkyard Station · Pocket Club]
    Hub --> Runtime[Thin Modoki / Three.js adapters]
    Runtime --> Build[Compact browser artifact]

    Quality[Machine quality contract] --> OwnershipGate[Complete module ownership · dynamic imports · cycle detection]
    Quality --> CodeGate[Strict types · focused owners · debt ratchet]
    Quality --> AssetGate[Recipe · provenance · GLB validation]
    Quality --> UiGate[Onboarding · island · six viewports · real interactions]
    Quality --> BudgetGate[Raw · gzip · brotli · JS ratchet]
    Quality --> WorkflowGate[Read-only source workflows · no staged delivery payloads]
    OwnershipGate --> CI[Reviewable reports]
    CodeGate --> CI
    AssetGate --> CI
    UiGate --> CI
    BudgetGate --> CI
    WorkflowGate --> CI
    Build --> CI

    SharedDomain -. forbidden .-> Three[Three.js · DOM · Modoki]
    GameDomain -. forbidden .-> Three

    Games --> BilliardsPresentation[Pocket Club SolidJS and Canvas presentation]
    BilliardsPresentation --> BilliardsDomain[Deterministic fixed-step CCD and 8-ball rules]
    BilliardsPresentation --> BilliardsNetwork[Optional Colyseus session adapter]
    BilliardsNetwork --> Proto[Versioned Protobuf contract]
    BilliardsNetwork --> BilliardsDomain
